Data files published in this repository's Releases are derived from OpenStreetMap data:

  - road network files: ua-roads.bin, kyiv-roads.bin, il-roads.bin
  - road extras (speed limits, cameras, level crossings, traffic calming): *-extras.bin
  - map tiles: map-*.pmtiles (Protomaps Basemap — a Produced Work under the ODbL)
  - routing and search data: *.sqlite
  - manifests describing these files: manifest.json

