Sources: Geofabrik extracts of OpenStreetMap (europe/ukraine-latest.osm.pbf,
asia/israel-and-palestine-latest.osm.pbf); Protomaps planet build (map tiles).
Built with the scripts in tools/ (roads: tools/roads/build_roads.py, format
tools/roads/FORMAT.md; extras: tools/roads/build_extras.py, format
tools/roads/FORMAT_EXTRAS.md; maps: tools/maps; routing and search: tools/nav).
